OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome clear spells and light winds
OL,7,Fallowing overnight frost to develop in
OL,8,Fplaces, as well as a few mist and fog
OL,9,Fpatches. Cloudier around the coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA dry but chilly morning with
OL,12,Fbright or sunny spells. Turning
OL,13,Fcloudier later with a few showers
OL,14,Fspreading south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
